{"games":[{"id":5400959086,"name":"[SCP] TASK FORCE","desc":"TASK FORCE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ \nTask Force is a tactical & realistic military simulator set in the SCP Universe. Being assigned on terrifying and life-threatening operations, do you have what it takes to serve the Foundation? Work with up to 11 other operatives, or go in solo. Your operation, your story. \n\nWho can you trust? Are your employers really the allies here? \n\nThis experience was made by Roman Entertainment\n\nBased on the SCP Universe\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━","path":"/game/5400959086-task-force","slug":"5400959086-task-force","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b80c20defafc2c67ba66e41c674b771d0572fc5ccee585c33d17ff40b21479f9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b4ff1c0092bd45d163bd87b24e42c73d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":45049758,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-01-15T01:11:39.092Z","creator":{"name":"Roman Entertainment","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":428375933,"name":"The Legend of The Bone Sword RPG","desc":"Embark on a perilous journey to reclaim your homeland from the Bone Lord's evil grasp. Progress through unique worlds and challenges as you grow stronger and collect strange weapons.\n\nBut things are not as they seem. Chaos lingers above, waiting to possess you at your darkest hour. How could you let this happen?\n\nThis game is a work in progress, please report any issues.\nThe old version is still available to play, just follow the floating platforms in The Old Sanctuary.\nThe classic version - https://www.roblox.com/games/6536023653/","path":"/game/428375933-the-legend-of-the-bone-sword-rpg","slug":"428375933-the-legend-of-the-bone-sword-rpg","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ccb4f139a83acd6e524f4c5ef1a9234adb3bb6060788c9958c27241fd9dd3c3d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8f8